  >
  >PARAMETER	Diabetes mortality relative risk: year cubic spline companion
  >LOCATION	Base(Diabetes).dat
  >LAST UPDATE	Jan 2015
  >
  >DESCRIPTION	Companion for the year cubic spline portion of the diabetes
